# `{{dashCase name}}` Engineering Constitution (Android Kotlin / Jetpack Compose App)

## 1. Pure Functional Core & Edge-to-Edge Compose (`ADR-007`)
- Keep domain state evaluation and formatting logic in pure Kotlin functions decoupled from Android `Context` or `Activity` instances.
- Use a Single-Activity Jetpack Compose architecture with `enableEdgeToEdge()` and Material 3 `Scaffold` window insets.

## 2. Convention Plugin & Firebase App Distribution Readiness
- Applies `id("stefs.android-app")` from `../../build-logic` (`compileSdk = 35`, `minSdk = 28`, `targetSdk = 35`, Compose enabled) and shares `../../gradle/libs.versions.toml`.
- Debug and release builds (`:app:assembleDebug`) produce distributable APK artifacts ready for Firebase App Distribution.

## 3. Verification Gate
Before any change is considered complete, all of the following must pass:
- `./gradlew :app:lintDebug`
- `./gradlew :app:assembleDebug`
- `./gradlew :app:testDebugUnitTest`
